y:Sensory spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]","text":""}],"full_text":"Neverlost is a spell that permits its user to detect energy radiating from hidden amulets.\n\n== History ==\nThe secret of this spell was contained in the Sceptre of Nefertiti. [The Sceptre Deception] After Klaus gained the sceptre, Neverlost was used by him to find the Titans within the Castle of Vlad Dracul. [The Vampire Loses Its Fangs]\n\nAt one point, Metz used Neverlost on a map. [OAL-075]\n\n==Gallery==\n\nNeverlost.png|Klaus using Neverlost\nNeverlost vlad druculs castle.png\n\n== International Names ==","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:Neverlost.png\n| aura  = Blue\n| class = Sensory\n| users =  [[Klaus]]<br>[[Metz]] ([[Huntik Trading Card Game|TCG]])\n| first = \"[[The Vampire Loses Its Fangs]]\"\n}}'''Neverlost''' is a spell that permits its user to detect energy radiating from hidden amulets.\n\n== History ==\nThe secret of this spell was contained in the [[Sceptre of Nefertiti]]. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}} After [[Klaus]] gained the sceptre, Neverlost was used by him to find the Titans within the [[Castle of Vlad Dracul]]. {{source|The Vampire Loses Its Fangs}}\n\nAt one point, [[Metz]] used Neverlost on a map. {{Source|OAL-075}}\n\n{{clear}}\n==Gallery==\n{{gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"left\">\nNeverlost.png|Klaus using Neverlost\nNeverlost vlad druculs castle.png\n</gallery>\n\n== International Names ==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall|POR=Sempre-eterno|DUT=Nooitverlies}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Sensory spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]","categories":["Blue-aura spells","Huntik Foundation magic","Magic","Organization magic","Sensory spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"Klaus","label":"Klaus","target_id":"huntik:page:3241","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3241"},{"ta